stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> AVAILABLE
  AVAILABLE --> HELD: checkout reserve(quantity, expiresAt)
  HELD --> COMMITTED: Supplier accepts; order is PAID or confirmed COD
  HELD --> RELEASED: payment failed / TTL expired / supplier rejects
  RELEASED --> AVAILABLE: quantity returned
  COMMITTED --> ADJUSTED: return accepted or manual stock adjustment
  ADJUSTED --> AVAILABLE: quantity restored when resaleable
  COMMITTED --> [*]: fulfilled and no stock return
